# Raw Data Directory
Place your raw blood smear images here.

## Directory Structure
- `sickle_cell/` - Sickle cell disease images
- `malaria/` - Malaria parasite images  
- `normal/` - Normal blood cell images
- `other_diseases/` - Other blood disorder images

## File Naming Convention
Use the following naming pattern:
`{disease_type}_{patient_id}_{image_id}.{extension}`

Example: `sickle_cell_001_01.jpg`